=2 Walkthrough
* Travel to the Fortilace in {z:Rolanberry Fields (S)} (D-9).
* Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into {z:Ruhotz Silvermines}.
* A party of 3 {m:Quadavs|Quadav} will be roaming the area. You must defeat them before they defeat the friendly NPC.
